<h1>The grind</h1>
<p>Espresso starts at the grinder. Water passes through the puck in under thirty seconds, so the coffee must be ground fine enough to slow it down, and evenly enough that it flows through all of it.</p>
<p>Too coarse, and the shot runs fast, thin and sour. Too fine, and it chokes, slow and bitter. Change one step at a time, and taste each shot.</p>
<p class="lesson__next">The course menu takes you to the next page: Extraction.</p>
